# Build context for services/api-server/Dockerfile (context: repo root).
# Allowlist: send only what that Dockerfile copies, so secrets (.env),
# git history, logs, venvs and client data never reach a build or an image.
*
!services/api-server/requirements.lock
!services/api-server/app/
!lib/code-fetcher/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/logs
